Sval: move the panel and page down with the toolbar under the macOS menu bar

In a full-screen window, macOS slides its menu bar and title bar over the
window's top edge, and `FullScreen.shiftMacToolbarDown` moves the toolbox
below them. Sval lays the Workspace panel and the page out in `#browser`,
below the toolbox, so they take the same shift, or the toolbar covers their
top edge.

